From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 18:18:16 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] llama: sample a repeated prompt from its saved logits

The last token of an identical prompt is not run again; its logit row was kept. A top-k row is reused only when the new sampler stays inside that set. Sliding-window and recurrent models still recompute the token. LLAMA_PROMPT_LOGITS=0 restores the rewind.
---
